        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/f/b5ac83/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2014-02-21T14:51:52.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>So we were playing last night and one hero was \"The Greatest Legacy\" whose power reads, \"1 Hero regains 1 HP and may use a power now\"</p><p>This person used this power on Legacy who used this power on Legacy and so on until Legacy was back to full HP. &nbsp;Every turn Legacy would return to full HP and when he played the card that redirected all damage to Legacy the game was over.</p><p><span>This is clearly not the intent of the card. &nbsp;Should it be \"1 OTHER Hero regains 1 HP and may use a power now\" or can Legacy use it on himself once?</span></p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:40:26.483Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
