        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/foote/{size}/1877_2.png",
        "created_at": "2014-02-21T14:56:47.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Ronway\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ronway/48/1856_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Ronway:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Gung-ho, like all powers, can only be used once per turn.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>This. Any instance of a power may only be used once per turn per card.</p>\n<p>So Legacy with just his Ring in play can't Galvinize twice in a row since you can only use that instance of a power once per turn.</p>",
